es assert exact episode counts instead of [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]tolerances, and the contract-set budget guard stops depending on [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]real elapsed wall clock. The four nodes that failed `just [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]test-contention` at the land attempt are fixed by mechanism under [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the same discipline. The wait-helper gate stops missing the idiom [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]it was built to retire, so post-epic commits cannot silently [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]reintroduce it. Only then does sase-h8 close and sase-ct close on [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the measured, enforced criterion the epic promised.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]flake_class_residue.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/flake_class_residue.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim] Parent: [#87AFFF][/dim]202608/parallel_suite_flake_class.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-h8.10[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-h8/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]sase-h8.10.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Actually implement the clock phase that sase-h8.5 closed [/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]without landing[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]clock[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]clock: drive `EventLoopStallWatchdog` from an injectable time source so [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the five F2 `test_stall_watchdog.py` nodes plus [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`test_nested_pause_requires_final_resume_before_detection` produce hitch[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and stall episodes deterministically, restore exact episode counts in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]place of the `>= 1` tolerances two prior fixes installed, keep one [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]real-timer end-to-end test, and move [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`test_contract_set_serial_runtime_stays_within_budget` off wall clock [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]now that sase-h8.7's F6 fix unblocked it.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Fix the four nodes that failed the sase-h8.9 exit criterion[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]residue[dim] · [dim][/dim]after clock[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]residue: fix the four nodes `just test-contention` failed on at the land[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]attempt — three wall-clock-shaped [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](`test_first_page_paints_before_full_extension`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`test_lowered_threshold_soak_keeps_fixed_paths_responsive`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`test_timed_out_summary_script_never_blocks_launch`) and one off-pump [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](`test_apostrophe_enters_jump_mode_with_hints_skipping_headers`) — using[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the conventions `clock` establishes and the sase-h8.2 wait primitive.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Close the wait-idiom gate gaps that let the retired pattern [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]back in[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]gate-gaps[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate-gaps: widen `tools/check_test_wait_helpers` past the two roots and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the one function name it currently matches so it catches the sixth [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`_wait_until` copy, the inline `for _ in range(N): await pilot.pause()` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bounded-wait loops that landed after the epic's waits phase, and the raw[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ACE panel injections sase-h8.6 asked for; migrate every call site the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]widened check reports.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Meet the exit criterion, close sase-ct, and close the epic[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]land[dim] · [dim][/dim]after clock, residue, gate-gaps[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]land: re-run all four sase-h8 exit criteria on the combined tree, file [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]genuinely distinct residue with /sase_new_task, close sase-ct with the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]note its plan specifies, then close sase-h8, run `just symvision` and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]remove what it reports, and mark both plan files done.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-h8.10","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","phase_bead_id":"sase-h8.10.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-27910e09b97479a293e4bbb65685f22a","started_at":"2026-08-08T14:57:39.105092+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"58bc55928dfb3b8f341d9b4ca9ed6a14b2ba9e3a841fceb1b10afb286c7ea4bc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-h8.land/chat.md","size_bytes":3793},"commits":{"digest":"03e33328e68fa883f959829c144285bd1c2a66010a4ff9bdceb2cf4475bfff89","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-h8.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-h8.land/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"e53de3f3d42edda02d57c6efb13d02484f68c9d6bb66ad3523bf7d93d58ab3bf","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-h8.land/meta.json","size_bytes":575},"prompt":{"digest":"2cfbad126944fbf4473621fa96167a083151f7331d41d255b7f382783a83c9bf","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-h8.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":365},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"c30826dbefb0386f279a11fb7fbfe72c225cb132181dac20a47b5fc19415cb5e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-h8.land/pro